---
description: Establish the actual observations relevant to the requested assigned-desktop question.
args:
  goal: string
  desk: DesktopDesk
returns: DesktopReadinessEvidence
---
Determine which current observations bear on this question, then compose the available exact scoped readers and semantic client-development branch. Layout residency and recovery, retained update identity and events, and source/admission readiness are distinct kinds of evidence. Independent observations may be acquired together when useful; one classification is not a substitute for another domain's actual facts.

Use the assigned desk and its exact operation identity. Return the actual observations with that desk, using null for a component you did not acquire. Do not read unrelated client source merely to fill a result field, invent a window/update observation, turn an unavailable read into a ready classification, or repeat an operation after its authority has changed. No mutation, installation, trust decision or layout restoration is authorized by this computation.
